 ('1885075',
  'Designing and building a transparent last mile delivery system : Optimizing '
  'efficiency and visibility in the final stretch: Building a transparent last '
  'mile delivery solution (Utformning och utveckling av ett transparent system '
  'för sista milens leverans : Optimering av effektivitet och synlighet i '
  'slutskedet: Bygga en transparent lösning för sista milens leverans)',
  '\n'
  'the primary objective in this thesis is to describe the implemented system '
  'designed to enhance the efficiency and add transparency of last-mile '
  'delivery processes, with a specific focus on the municipality helsingborg '
  'stad in sweden. within logistics and supply chain management, the last mile '
