[('769351',
  'Gesture Keyboard USING MACHINE LEARNING',
  '\n'
  'the market for mobile devices is expanding rapidly. input of text is a '
  'large part of using a mobile device and an input method that is convenient '
  'and fast is therefore very interesting. gesture keyboards allow the user to '
  'input text by dragging a finger over the letters in the desired word. this '
